<!doctype html>
<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Divine Mercy College Foundation Inc. | LMS</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css"></head>
<body><div id="app">
<header class="topbar"><div class="brand"><img src="assets/logo.png" alt="Divine Mercy College Foundation seal"><div><strong>DIVINE MERCY</strong><span>COLLEGE FOUNDATION INC.</span></div></div><nav id="header-nav"><button class="btn light" data-login="teacher">Teacher Login</button><button class="btn" data-login="admin">Admin Login</button></nav></header>
<main id="landing" class="landing"><section class="hero"><div class="hero-copy"><p class="eyebrow">LEARN • GROW • EXCEL</p><h1>Welcome to <em>Divine Mercy</em> College Foundation Inc.</h1><p class="lead">A shared space for teachers to support student progress, manage learning content, and celebrate mastery.</p><div class="hero-actions"><button class="btn large" data-login="teacher">Teacher Portal <span>→</span></button><button class="btn outline large" data-login="admin">Administrator Portal</button></div><div class="hero-foot"><span class="dot"></span> Learning management system</div></div><div class="hero-art"><div class="seal-ring"><img src="assets/logo.png" alt="College seal"></div><div class="art-caption">DIVINUM ET SAPIENTIA <b>·</b> EST. 1990</div></div></section><section class="features"><div><span class="feature-icon">▤</span><b>Student insights</b><p>Track progress and assessment scores.</p></div><div><span class="feature-icon">✎</span><b>Learning content</b><p>Manage questions and activities in one place.</p></div><div><span class="feature-icon">◉</span><b>Secure portals</b><p>Dedicated access for teachers and administrators.</p></div></section></main>
<div id="login-modal" class="modal hidden"><div class="modal-card"><button id="close-modal" class="close">×</button><div class="modal-mark"><img src="assets/logo.png" alt=""></div><p class="eyebrow" id="login-eyebrow">WELCOME BACK</p><h2 id="login-title">Teacher Login</h2><p class="muted">Sign in with your account credentials.</p><form id="login-form"><input type="hidden" name="role" id="login-role" value="teacher"><label id="username-label">Teacher ID</label><input name="username" id="login-username" autocomplete="username" required placeholder="Enter your teacher ID"><label>Password</label><input type="password" name="password" autocomplete="current-password" required placeholder="Enter password"><div id="login-error" class="error"></div><button class="btn full" type="submit">Sign in <span>→</span></button></form></div></div>
<div id="portal" class="portal hidden"><aside class="sidebar"><div class="side-brand"><img src="assets/logo.png" alt=""><div><b>DIVINE MERCY</b><small>COLLEGE FOUNDATION</small></div></div><div class="user-mini"><div class="mini-avatar" id="mini-avatar">DM</div><div><b id="side-name">Account</b><small id="side-role">Portal</small></div></div><nav id="side-nav"></nav><div class="sidebar-bottom"><button class="nav-item" id="sidebar-logout">↪ <span>Log out</span></button><small>Divinum et Sapientia</small></div></aside><section class="workspace"><div class="workspace-head"><div><p class="eyebrow" id="page-kicker">OVERVIEW</p><h1 id="page-title">Dashboard</h1></div><div class="head-right"><span class="today" id="today"></span><div class="head-avatar" id="head-avatar">DM</div></div></div><div id="page-content"></div></section></div>
<div id="toast" class="toast"></div></div><script src="app.js"></script></body></html>